    "Ten physical non-emissive nonmetallic timber roles distinguish sparse lacquer columns, brown primary beams, warm bracket arms, pale actual cut ends, roof boards, thin brown-red fascia and recessed window parts. The existing independent scan contributes normalized grain once; the material baseColor stays white.",
